   "source": [
    "## 1. Testing Philosophy & Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why Unit Tests Matter for SpecCoder\n",
    "\n",
    "SpecCoder is a **code generation system** where reliability is critical. A single bug in parsing or validation can generate incorrect code that affects downstream systems. Our testing philosophy is built on three pillars:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Prevention** - Catch issues before they reach production\n",
    "2. **Documentation** - Tests serve as living documentation of expected behavior\n",
    "3. **Regression Protection** - Ensure changes don't break existing functionality\n",
    "\n",
    "### Test Architecture Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "tests/\n",
    "├── conftest.py              # Global pytest configuration\n",
    "├── test_spec_parser.py      # Unit tests for spec parsing\n",
    "├── test_generator.py        # Unit tests for code generation\n",
    "├── test_orchestrator.py     # Unit tests for pipeline orchestration\n",
    "├── test_tester.py          # Unit tests for test analysis\n",
    "├── test_cli.py             # Unit tests for CLI interface\n",
    "├── test_organizer.py       # Unit tests for code organization\n",
    "├── test_templates.py       # Unit tests for prompt templates\n",
    "├── test_healer.py          # Unit tests for code healing\n",
    "├── test_ollama_client.py   # Unit tests for AI client\n",
    "├── test_parse_tests.py     # Unit tests for test parsing\n",
    "├── test_compare_behaviors.py # Unit tests for behavior comparison\n",
    "├── integration/            # Integration tests\n",
    "│   ├── test_generator_integration.py\n",
    "│   ├── test_orchestrator_integration.py\n",
    "│   └── ...\n",
    "└── e2e/                   # End-to-end tests\n",
    "    └── test_end_to_end_pipeline.py\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Test Categories & Their Purpose\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Unit Tests** - Fast, isolated tests of individual components\n",
    "2. **Integration Tests** - Tests of component interactions with real dependencies\n",
    "3. **End-to-End Tests** - Full pipeline tests with real data and AI models"
   ]
  },
