    "## 6. Best Practices & Troubleshooting\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on our analysis, let's document the key testing best practices and common issues."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Comprehensive best practices summary\n",
    "print(\"\"\"\n",
    "Unit Testing Best Practices for SpecCoder:\n",
    "========================================\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Test Structure:\n",
    "   - AAA Pattern: Arrange, Act, Assert\n",
    "   - One assertion per test when possible\n",
    "   - Descriptive test names that explain what and why\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Fixture Design:\n",
    "   - Create reusable fixtures for common setup\n",
    "   - Use yield for setup/teardown patterns\n",
    "   - Keep fixtures focused and single-purpose\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Test Data:\n",
    "   - Use realistic data, not oversimplified examples\n",
    "   - Test both happy path and edge cases\n",
    "   - Create invalid data to test error handling\n",
    "\n",
    "4. Mocking Strategy:\n",
    "   - Mock external dependencies, not internal logic\n",
    "   - Use patch for dependency injection\n",
    "   - Verify mock calls to ensure proper interaction\n",
    "\n",
    "5. Assertion Strategy:\n",
    "   - Assert specific values, not just truthiness\n",
    "   - Test both positive and negative cases\n",
    "   - Use appropriate assertion methods for clarity\n",
    "\n",
    "6. Test Isolation:\n",
    "   - Each test should be independent\n",
    "   - Use temporary directories for file operations\n",
    "   - Clean up resources to prevent pollution\n",
    "\"\"\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Common troubleshooting scenarios\n",
    "print(\"\"\"\n",
    "Common Testing Issues & Solutions:\n",
    "=================================\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Test Pollution:\n",
    "   - Problem: Tests affecting each other\n",
    "   - Solution: Use fixtures with proper cleanup\n",
    "   - Detection: Tests pass individually but fail in suite\n",
    "\n",
    "2. File Permission Issues:\n",
    "   - Problem: Tests can't create/delete files\n",
    "   - Solution: Use tempfile.mkdtemp() in user-writable location\n",
    "   - Detection: PermissionError during test execution\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Import Path Issues:\n",
    "   - Problem: Can't import modules under test\n",
    "   - Solution: Ensure PYTHONPATH includes source directory\n",
    "   - Detection: ModuleNotFoundError\n",
    "\n",
    "4. Mock Configuration:\n",
    "   - Problem: Mocks not applied correctly\n",
    "   - Solution: Use correct import paths in patch decorators\n",
    "   - Detection: Real code executes instead of mock\n",
    "\n",
    "5. Test Data Issues:\n",
    "   - Problem: Test data doesn't match expected format\n",
    "   - Solution: Validate test data structure matches real data\n",
    "   - Detection: Tests fail with unexpected validation errors\n",
    "\n",
    "6. Timing Issues:\n",
    "   - Problem: Tests are slow or timeout\n",
    "   - Solution: Mock external dependencies, use efficient fixtures\n",
    "   - Detection: Tests take > 1 second or timeout\n",
